    <briefdescription>
<para>Configures a single JSON REST or GraphQL API endpoint. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Government REST APIs (e.g. Bundesanzeiger, EUR-Lex REST)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>JS-build API endpoints (webpack-dev-server, Vite, Next.js)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>React SPA backends that expose /api/* routes </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
